==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Firecracker]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Firecracker]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Firecracker]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Firecracker]]s spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Make sure to bring plenty of [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red Cats]] as this stage contains only them with the exception of the Firework Guys. Examples include [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat/Island Cat]] and its [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed/Manic counterpart]], [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)|Maximum the Fighter]], [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fried Shrimp Cat]], [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]], and many others. Don't forget meatshields either as the constant barrage of Yonshakudama Fireworks can be lethal.

